      "id": "claim_f5bed61639a54f0a85a3a5bf2559beaa",
      "statement": "Rust prepare and the inverted index take no multi_span_evidence input; the flag is passed only at citation-build time (PreparedCorpus.build_citations / rust_build_citations_fast), and multi-span extraction is a per-alignment step that does not change the prepared corpus surface. Prepare uses SimpleTokenizer + simple_segment on the default path.",
